+/* Experimental, opt-in only (RECOMP_SYNTHESIZE_VBLANK=1): fire the guest's
+ * own NV2A/vblank ISR (sub_004E16FA) from inside whatever guest thread is
+ * already here polling/yielding, at roughly 60 Hz. See PROJECT_STATUS.md
