+     * so even a nonzero status alone would still exit early at that second
+     * check. Both registers are unbacked guest memory, freely writable;
+     * completing the experiment by synthesizing both, targeting the
+     * specific "vblank/counter" reason bit (0x20) this ISR's own logic
+     * checks for (see the read of sub_004E16FA in PROJECT_STATUS.md) rather
+     * than the unrelated bit-0 or "other" DPC-queuing paths. */
+    {
